TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 equilibrated with minerals
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings mol_Fe2 mol_Fe3
    10 PUNCH TOT("Fe(+2)"), TOT("Fe(+3)")
END
